{"id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-lob-internal.md","title":"Internal Löb Theorem","display":"thm-lob-internal — Internal Löb Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-lob-internal","aliases":["89-thm-lob-internal"],"display":"thm-lob-internal — Internal Löb Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","[[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-lob-internal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-lob-internal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lob-internal — Internal Löb Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d\" href=\"?note=4a8ab8e4bad7b12d\" title=\"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma\">89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 为递归可枚举的算术理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>；使用固定经典算术证明关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的固定算术可证性公式，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对任意算术句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，局部句法缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_T(B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner})\">\\(P_T(B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner})\\)</span>；每次嵌套重新编码整个参数句子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}internal}\\vdash\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\nP_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)\\to P_T(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}internal}\\vdash\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\nP_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)\\to P_T(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，pp.59–62；印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。本条是 T 内的 Löb 公理实例，不是“若 T 证明反射句则 T 证明其结论”的外部规则。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=P_T\">\\(P=P_T\\)</span>。广义对角引理取一个无参数句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\delta\\leftrightarrow(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\delta\\leftrightarrow(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>，该等价也在 T 中成立。以下每步均在 T 中证明。由 HB 的第一、第二条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\delta\\to P(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)\">\\(P\\delta\\to P(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>；第三条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\delta\\to P(P\\delta)\">\\(P\\delta\\to P(P\\delta)\\)</span>。第二条件再给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\delta\\to P\\varphi\">\\(P\\delta\\to P\\varphi\\)</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)\">\\((P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>，结合对角等价得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\delta\">\\((P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\delta\\)</span>。对这条 T 定理用第一、第二条件，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to P\\delta\">\\(P(P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to P\\delta\\)</span>，再合成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\delta\\to P\\varphi\">\\(P\\delta\\to P\\varphi\\)</span> 即得结论。此推导不使用 GL 的算术可靠性，依赖没有循环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","status":"resolved","id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"P_T(B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}internal}\\vdash\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\nP_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)\\to P_T(\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"P=P_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\delta\\leftrightarrow(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\delta\\to P(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\delta\\to P(P\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\delta\\to P\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"(P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to(P\\delta\\to\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"(P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"P(P\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to P\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"P\\delta\\to P\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1952,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab8391d7623da45d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 51–62；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n对 GL 有限证明归纳。命题重言式的翻译在经典 PA 中可证；K 由第二派生条件验证；Löb 模式由 [[89-thm-lob-internal]] 在 $T=\\mathrm{PA}$ 时的对象语言定理验证；MP 保可证性；必然化由第一派生条件验证。PA 的三条件见独立原子 [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]。此方向不要求 PA 在自身内部证明一致性，也不使用外部反模型构造。"},{"id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"证明：若 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi$，HB 第一条件给出 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)$；[[89-thm-lob-internal]] 再给出 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)$，最后 MP 得 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi$。这里的 $P_T$ 取该原子已展开的句法缩写。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-lob-internal]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] → [[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]] → [[89-thm-lob-internal]] → [[89-thm-lob-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-principle]] → [[89-df-gls-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["9aca87310232fb2f","4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","2e7227755a8473e0"]}